331	    /**
332	     * Reduce an address to its canonical stored form: trim and collapse runs of
333	     * whitespace to a single space, upper-case, and expand common abbreviations
334	     * ({@code ST -> STREET}, {@code RD -> ROAD}, {@code AVE -> AVENUE}) whenever
335	     * they appear as whole words. The result is what is stored, returned and used
336	     * for every household comparison; it is idempotent, so re-normalising an
337	     * already-normalised address leaves it unchanged.
338	     *
